# --- Third-party payloads: cached locally, never redistributed ---------------
# Ken French Data Library, FRED and Binance payloads whose redistribution terms
# are not ours to grant. data/provenance.json keeps each source URL, retrieval
# timestamp, row count, date range and SHA-256, so a reader re-fetches and
# verifies byte-for-byte; the connectors recreate this directory on first run.
data/raw/

