# Builds the hand-uploaded Zenodo archive from `git ls-files`. A tool for
# publishing the repository is not itself part of the repository.
tools/package_zenodo.py

# --- Manuscript: NEVER published here ----------------------------------------
# This repository is the benchmark, not the paper. The article source, its build
# products and the Elsevier submission package live alongside it on disk and are
# never distributed. tools/verify_manuscript.py detects their absence and skips.
#
# Deliberately broader than the one directory that exists today: the article must
# not reach this repository under any name, in any location.
manuscript/
manuscript*/
paper/
paper*/
*.tex
*.bib
*.bbl
*.cls
*.sty
cover_letter*
highlights.txt
# Not *.pdf -- experiments/output/ ships sixteen tracked figure PDFs.